<LANGUAGE>
	<!--
	I have taken this file from the original Amnesia config folder and stripped much of the contents.
	What remains are the unique categories and some examples of entries from each of them.
	Feel free to remove, add or rename them, as long as they reflect what's required by the game/script.
	As for the comments, you may remove them as you wish, or keep them. Up to you.

	SYNTAX:
	[br] 				- apply a line break
	[new_page] 			- split text into a new page (for notes/diaries)
	[voice file.ogg] 	- Play a voice file along with a note/diary with "file.ogg" as the sound file.
	* 					- Start a line with * to apply special font effects (examples in credits).
	-->

	<RESOURCES>
		<Directory Path="fonts/eng" />
		<Directory Path="lang/eng" />
	</RESOURCES>

	<!-- Inventory -->

	<CATEGORY Name="Inventory">
		<Entry Name="ItemName_ChemicalContainer">Chemistry Pot</Entry>
		<Entry Name="ItemDesc_ChemicalContainer">A pot to contain mixtures of all sorts.</Entry>
	</CATEGORY>

	<!-- Journal -->

	<CATEGORY Name="Journal">

		<!-- Notes -->

		<Entry Name="Note_Historian1_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian1_Text">Year is 1615.[br][br]Writing is local historian who is preparing for a trip to a village in Prussia.[br][br]He has heard stories of a castle in the region and its influence in the local culture and he would like to study it.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian2_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian2_Text">Year is 1615.[br][br]Writing is local historian who is collecting lore about the area. He mentions that "the castle" plays a big part in stories told.[br][br]The historian says that he is intrigued and will visit the castle the next day.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian3_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian3_Text">Year is 1615.[br][br]Writing is local historian who is currently visiting "the castle". He says that it has no inhabitants, but it appears that it exhibits signs of someone living inside of it for quite a while.[br][br]He writes that he'll be investigating it further for the next few days.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian4_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Historian4_Text">Year is 1615.[br][br]Writing is local historian who is currently investigating "the castle". He says he has found further evidence of some sort of human activity within the castle. He also mentions strange findings of ritualistic tools within it[br][br]He is considering leaving, but he is too intrigued and invested in finding out what is going on within "the castle".</Entry>
		
		<Entry Name="Note_Count1_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Count1_Text">Year is 1337.[br][br]Writing is the count of the castle who talks about a disputed heritage within his family. One of his brothers is disputing his feudal lands and that includes the possession of the castle.[br][br]He is currently examining ways of settling down the dispute and is very annoyed at the situation.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Count2_Name">DIARY ENTRY</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_Count2_Text">Year is 1337.[br][br]Writing is the count of the castle who is in a deep dilemma about his disputed heritage. Other family members are pressuring him to give up ownership of the castle, but he is greatly reluctant, citing some sort of treasure deep within its walls that he is searching for.[br][br]He mentions that he is considering taking drastic measures to keep others away from the castle.</Entry>
		
		<Entry Name="Note_ArchivesRebuilding_Name">NOTE</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_ArchivesRebuilding_Text">Year is 1333.[br][br]Writing is the count of the castle who is currently in the process of expanding and rebuilding the archives. He has expanded the area eastwards and is currently planning on building a cellar area for it, but complains of frequent spider infestations.</Entry>

		<Entry Name="Note_LocalStories_Name">NOTE</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_LocalStories_Text">Strange stories told about the castle from villagers. Talks about strange creates seen in the forest around the castle and one woman swears here she saw her dead cat running around.</Entry>
		
		<Entry Name="Note_LaboratoryAcid_Name">NOTE</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Note_LaboratoryAcid_Text">Year is 1225.[br][br]Writing is the court alchemist who talks about a new recipe for a new type of acid. He says the ingredients are quite unstable, though, and that he is moving everything to the wine cellar to keep them safe there.</Entry>

		<!-- Mementos -->

		<Entry Name="Quest_QHollowNeedle_Name">Hollow Needle - Archives</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QHollowNeedle_Text">To begin this adventure, search for a hollow needle in the Archives.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QLantern_Name">Illuminate - Archives</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QLantern_Text">Search behind every book in the Archives to find a lantern.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QAcid_Name">Acid Pòtion - Wine Cellar</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QAcid_Text">Create an acid potion from ingredients found in the Wine Cellar.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QAcidSpider_Name">Spider Web - Archives</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Quest_QAcidSpider_Text">Use the acid potion on the Spider Web in the Archives.</Entry>

		<!-- Diaries -->

		<Entry Name="Diary_Test_Name1">Test Entry: Overture</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Diary_Test_Name2">Test Entry: Requiem</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Diary_Test_Text1">[voice player_react_guardian2.ogg][br]This is diary 1!!!![br][br]Nice nice![br][voice player_react_guardian2.ogg][br]this is the next paragraph tha the character speaks! Fun fun speaking![br][voice player_react_guardian2.ogg][br]Now for the final thing the character says...[br][br]Arghh.... I die.... diee.....DIE!</Entry>
		<Entry Name="Diary_Test_Text2">This is diary 2!!!![br][br]last last!</Entry>
	</CATEGORY>

	<!-- Voice -->

	<CATEGORY Name="Voice">
		<Entry Name="CH02L15_Alexander_01">Is he safe? Well, it's for his own good.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="CH02L15_Alexander_02">Soon it will be ready. Let there be enough time.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="CH02L15_Alexander_03">He escaped? Where is he now?</Entry>
	</CATEGORY>

	<!-- Flashbacks -->

	<CATEGORY Name="Flashbacks">
		<Entry Name="CH01L00_DanielsMind01_01">Don't forget... some things mustn't be forgotten. The shadow hunting me... I must hurry.</Entry>
		<Entry Name="CH01L00_DanielsMind02_01">My name is Daniel, I live in London at... at... Mayfair...</Entry>
		<Entry Name="CH01L00_DanielsMind03_01">What have I done? This is crazy. Don't forget, don't forget. I must stop him. Focus!</Entry>
		<Entry Name="CH01L00_DanielsMind04_01">My name is...is... I am Daniel.</Entry>
	</CATEGORY>

